  abilityId: 2840998
  abilityName: Howling Eclipse
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), 12 combo Thunder attack on single foe (25% active Pierce on Water, Thunder
    foes), boosts Atk, Def, Rec relative to max HP for 4 turns, boosts Thunder elemental
    damage for 4 turns, spark damage fills BB gauge for 4 turns & boosts max HP
